  "comentarios": "At least two different males (one on the island marked, the other on the nearby mainland) and one female (also on the mainland). I'd more expected to find M. surinamensis here, but didn't. We found multostriata at multiple localities around Inirida, so it must get very close to the range of M. surinamensis in this region. Are they even in contact?",
